  "details": "1. Description (Problem Statement):\n\nIn the current VR chat, users are forced to use text input, which is inconvenient in a virtual reality environment and breaks immersion. Players want to quickly share emotions and the context of what is happening around them.\n\nGoal: To allow users to record and send short video clips (5-15 seconds) directly from within the VR space, in order to share impressions and invite friends to join.\n\n2. User Story (As a user):\n\n    As a VR player,\n\n    I want to be able to quickly record a short video message from my surroundings,\n\n    So that I can send it to a friend in the chat to show them how much fun I'm having and invite them to join me,\n\n    Instead of having to stop the game and type inconvenient text.",
